.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/7984","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7984","diff_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7984.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7984.patch","merged_at":"2026-11-09T07:57:10Z"},"body":"Closes the Phase 3 audit work for #3069 (design #3068); #3068 itself closes with a link to this evidence once merged.\n\nContents:\n- Contract statement (commit eb7c5044dc, pre-existing on this branch): the #3068 rule in pm-stack/aggregator/README.md (Parsed-shape contract section) and the bin/sync-models.mjs header.\n- Closing inventory audit (doc/2026-11-09_audit_3068-phase3-closing.md): gate verified (all nine Phase 1-2 issues closed), 698 raw parse sites inventoried across bin/, scripts/, pkgs/, pm-stack; dispositions (a)/(b)/(c) incl. the explicit ?? [] / || {} defaults review; MessagePack: zero decode sites in scope.\n- (b) follow-ups filed as #7983 (ten missed boundaries, risk-ordered).\n- #2608 ownership decided in the audit doc: fixed under its own PR #3463, not #2576 Phase 3 and not this phase.\n\nQueue task 4465, lane code-o.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796796288&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7984&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7984&signature=7d46abd7dc707caa4aa489ea8d86cee59270e4245efbf39e99a2da5dace03221\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"http